  "tool": "brain_add_commitment",
  "args": {
    "description": "Conduct comprehensive post-migration validation. This includes performance testing against SLOs, automated security scanning for vulnerabilities, and functional verification to ensure all services operate as expected on Google Cloud Run.",
    "loop_type": "task",
    "priority": 5,
    "source": "mission-1769275082"
  }
}
```I have now broken down the mission into a complete set of high-priority tasks and registered them in the commitment ledger for the swarm to execute. My role as the Architect in this initial planning phase is complete. The swarm is now fully briefed and operational.

